\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  Dlr Ends Higher; MAS  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  To Buy US Dlrs \b0\par\par\uc2 284 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Mai 2000\par 12:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2  -(Dow Jones)- The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to shore up the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar on Thursday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell to its lowest level in 13 months. \par \par \uc2  Around 1000 GMT, at the close of local trading, the U.S. dollar was at S$1.7267, down from S$1.7301 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar touched a high of S$1.7355 before the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore stepped in to buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Singapore dollars, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  That was the highest level for the U.S. dollar since it hit S$1.7357 on April 8, 1999. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar was dragged down by the Indonesian rupiah, which plunged following remarks by Senior Economics Minister Kwik Kian Gie, who said his country faces too much instability and social unrest to appeal to investors. \par \par \uc2  Expectations that the U.S. Federal Open Market Committee would raise interest rates by 50 basis points at its May 16 meeting also weighed on the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar and other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the MAS came as a surprise. Most dealers had said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to drift lower because of the dollar's recent strength against the euro, the yen and other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But one dealer said the MAS \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to calm the markets in the wake of "panic selling" of the rupiah and wasn't trying to determine the exchange rate against the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  In the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  money market, the overnight rate was offered at 2.125%, up from 1% on Wednesday. The three-month rate was offered at 3.0625%, up from 3%. \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5b02dkl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
