\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Ends At 11 Mo Low As US$ Surges In Asia \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Mai 2000\par 11:15\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- The Singapore dollar ended at its lowest level in almost a year Wednesday as the U.S. unit continued to gain against most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "Everyone wants to be long (on U.S.) dollars," a dealer at a U.S. bank said. "The regionals seem to be weakening across the board. I don't think it will end here." \par \par \uc2  Around 0850 GMT (4:50 a.m. EDT), the U.S. dollar was quoted at S$1.7302, up from S$1.7250 late Tuesday. The U.S. dollar was at its highest level since May 27, when it reached S$1.7317. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said, however, that the threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  was slowing the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decline. \par \par \uc2  Local banks, which often act at the behest of the MAS, were reportedly offering to sell the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the Singapore dollar at the level of S$1.7300. \par \par \uc2  Even so, some dealers added, Singapore's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken somewhat further if the U.S. dollar continues to rise in anticipation of higher U.S. interest rates. \par \par \uc2  "I see no reason for any action if U.S. dollar keeps strengthening across the board," the bank dealer said, adding that "S$1.74 is quite a sensible level to me." \par \par \uc2  Hedge funds and investment banks are buying the U.S. dollar cautiously for fear of drawing \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  money market, the overnight rate was offered at 1.00%, down from 3.00% late Tuesday. The three-month rate was offered at 3.000%, down from 3.0625%. \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5a02boc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
