 to the S$1.7400 level," Standard Chartered added. \par \par \uc2  -By Alan Yonan Jr. 65 421-4859; alan.yonan@dowjones.co \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5802asc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
