\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Ends At 9-Week Low As US Dlr Surges \b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Mai 2000\par 12:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- The Singapore dollar fell to its lowest level in nine weeks late Thursday as the U.S. dollar surged on world \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  Around 0935 GMT, the U.S. dollar was at S$1.7240, up from S$1.7186 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the Singapore dollar's weakness was a reflection of the U.S. dollar's strength against world \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , particularly the euro. \par \par \uc2  In coming trading sessions, the level of the Singapore dollar will be tied closely to the fate of the euro, traders in Singapore said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar broke decisively through a level of resistance at S$1.7200. That is the level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been considered likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  However, traders said that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is now unlikely because of the U.S. dollar's generalized strength against the euro, yen and other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "There is tremendous (U.S. dollar) strength across the board," said one trading desk chief for a European bank. "It's unbelievable." \par \par \uc2  Given U.S. dollar strength, the MAS may allow the Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to fall to between S$1.7300 and S$1.7400 to the U.S. dollar, said a dealer at a U.S. bank. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer predicted that the U.S. dollar could soon rise above S$1.7250, taking out stop-loss orders along the way. \par \par \uc2  In the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  money market, the overnight rate was offered at 2.3750%, up from 2.2500% late Wednesday. The three-month rate was offered at 2.6875%, up from 2.5625%. \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw54029lz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
