\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Ends Lower On Foreign Acquisitions,Weak Yen \b0\par\par\uc2 367 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 April 2000\par 10:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- The Singapore dollar ended lower Tuesday on yen weakness and news of foreign investments - actual and potential - by Singapore companies, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  After inching up for most of the day, the U.S. dollar briefly breached the sensitive S$1.7200 level, above which the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  is considered likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  However, the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell back without MAS \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Around 0835 GMT (4:35 a.m. EDT), the U.S. dollar was quoted at S$1.7197, up from S$1.7165 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar was weakened by news that Singapore Airlines had taken an 8.3% stake in Air New Zealand, paying NZ$141.3 million (NZ$1=US$0.4974). \par \par \uc2  Singapore Airlines is also in talks to acquire an additional 16.7% of Air New Zealand. \par \par \uc2  Singapore's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakens on such news on the expectation that corporations like Singapore Airlines will have to sell the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to finance acquisitions. \par \par \uc2  Other foreign investments are in the works. Singapore Telecommunications is in talks to buy stakes in Malaysia's Time Engineering and two of its subsidiaries in a deal that analysts say could be worth MYR2.1 billion (US$1=MYR3.80). \par \par \uc2  In addition, local newspapers reported Tuesday that the Government of Singapore Investment Corporation had been asked to bid for a stake in Indonesia's Bank Central Asia. Later in the day, Indonesia's Bank Restructuring Agency confirmed that GIC had been asked to make a bid. \par \par \uc2  Such news "does have an impact on the Singapore dollar just now," said David Simmonds, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Citibank. "There are likely to be further outflows relating to international mergers and acquisitions," he said. \par \par \uc2  A weaker yen also contributed to the Singapore dollar's decline Tuesday, because the yen constitutes a large part of the basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the Singapore dollar trades, dealers added. \par \par \uc2  In the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  money market, the overnight rate was offered at 1.625%, unchanged from late Monday. The three-month rate was offered at 2.3125%, also unchanged. \par \par \uc2  -By Christopher Wellisz; 65/ 421-4802; christopher.wellisz@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw4b01ubo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
