\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  - Sturdy despite  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 951 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 April 2000\par 04:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2 , April 3 (Reuters) - Regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were \par \par \uc2  looking generally brighter in early Monday trade despite \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the yen\tab     and on the won\tab    .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The yen was pushed to around 102.00 per dollar -- its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par highest rate in nearly three months - on Friday amid rising\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par expectations of economic recovery in Japan but had slipped by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par early Asia on news Japanese Prime Minister Keizo Obuchi had\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par been hospitalised.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Japanese Government later said Obuchi had suffered a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stroke and was in intensive care.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The yen later eased to 105 per dollar on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Finance Ministry International Bureau head Zembei Mizoguchi\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par also confirmed the Bank of Japan (BOJ) had \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market early and reiterated that abrupt \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  movements were\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par undesirable.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The BOJ's quarterly "tankan" business sentiment index for\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par major manufacturers came in within market expectations in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par March, at minus nine and up from minus 17 in December.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par KOREAN WON\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Heavy dollar buying from the open believed to have been\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par orchestrated by the authorities knocked the won off fresh\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 28-month highs of around 1,104 per dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The won had been propelled higher at the open by exporter\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar sales by exporters and the yen's bullish tone.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     South Korea March imports rose 52.8 percent to $14.22\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par billion year-on-year while exports climbed 25.3 percent to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par $14.6 billion, according to the commerce ministry.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The trade account came in at a provisional surplus of $382\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par million, representing an 83.8 percent decline from a $2.35\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par billion surplus in March 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     INDONESIAN RUPIAH\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Although little changed compared to its close on Friday,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the rupiah was still looking weak at around 7,600.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said the market was awaiting government action to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fulfil pledges made to the IMF to secure the IMF's next $400\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par million loan payment and persuade creditors to reschedule the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par country's debt at a Paris Club meeting on April 12.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Chief economics minister Kwik Kian Gie has said the country\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par has until April 12 to complete 42 tasks from its latest letter\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of intent to the IMF, including starting legal action against\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par uncooperative debtors, clamping down on on corruption and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par recapitalising state banks.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers say the dollar is likely to remain well bid and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par that the rupiah will find support at around the 7,500 level.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Singapore dollar was well bid at the upper end of its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par recent 1.71 per dollar range on the back of renewed yen\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par strength.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said it would be advisable to sell on any sustained\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar move higher if the yen remains firm.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The island's Purchasing Managers' Index (PMI) for March\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rose 4.3 percentage points to 62.5 percent month-on-month on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the back of higher order and output growth. The manufacturing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par index hit its highest level since June 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Singapore's PMI has been above 50 percent since January\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par last year, indicating 15 months of expansion in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par manufacturing sector.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PHILIPPINE PESO\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso was supported by strong January-February exports\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par which rose 9.1 percent year-on-year to $5.62 billion.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Investors were also cautious about aggressively selling the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par peso after \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Governor Rafael Buenaventura said on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Sunday the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market if necessary to ensure the peso's stability.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He said the unit should strengthen to 40.90 mark "very\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par soon" as the central will not let the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  "get out of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par control."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was also heartened by news of a sharp rise in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par remittance from overseas Filipino workers in 1999. More than\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par five million overseas workers sent home $6.794 billion last\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par year, a 38 percent rise from the previous year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par THAI BAHT\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The baht hovered around the upper end of the recent range,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par underpinned by tight baht liquidity during tax payments and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par holiday season as well as strong economic numbers released on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Friday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The market awaited March consumer prices and whole sale\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par prices numbers to be released by Commerce Ministry at 0400 GMT.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Salomon Smith Barney said despite high oil prices, the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par March inflation should remain tame.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "While costs have risen due to higher oil prices, we expect\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the still sizeable output gap to continue to put a cap\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par inflation," it said in a report.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The market will also watch closely domestic political\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par developments following the resignation of powerful Interior\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Minister Sanan Kachornprasart who was accused of false asset\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par declarations last week. He denied any wrongdoing.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TAIWAN DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Taiwan dollar was well bid in early offshore trade\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par though little activity was expected with domestic \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stock markets shut for a one-day Women and Children's Day\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par holiday.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. $0150 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     105.22\tab  105.09\tab    -0.12\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7123\tab  1.7184\tab    +0.36\par  Taiwan dlr    30.449\tab  30.490\tab    +0.13\par  Korean won   1110.50\tab 1105.70\tab    -0.43\par  Baht\tab      37.80\tab   37.90\tab    +0.26\par  Peso\tab      41.14\tab   41.13\tab    -0.01\par  Rupiah\tab  7600.00\tab 7605.00\tab    +0.07\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.7995\tab    +0.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \tab Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     105.22\tab  102.21\tab    -2.86\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.7123\tab  1.6640\tab    -2.82\par  Taiwan dlr    30.449\tab  31.380\tab    +3.06\par  Korean won   1110.50\tab 1135.00\tab    +2.21\par  Baht\tab      37.80\tab   37.45\tab    -0.93\par  Peso\tab      41.14\tab   40.20\tab    -2.27\par  Rupiah\tab  7600.00\tab 6975.00\tab    -8.22\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.8000\tab    +0.01\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Desk (65) 870-3087\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par email:asia.\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 @reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 2000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw43033ne\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
