\par\par \b \uc2  Brunei Turmoil Seen Having Little Effect On Singapore Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 320 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Februar 2000\par 05:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- Charges of financial mismanagement against Prince Jefri of Brunei should have little, if any, impact on the Singapore dollar, analysts said Friday. \par \par \uc2  Although Brunei's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is pegged to the Singapore dollar, the news of the charges Thursday doesn't appear to be of much concern to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders, the analysts said. \par \par \uc2  "This should not have any material impact on the Singapore dollar," said Song Seng Wun, economist at G.K. Goh Research in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  "Both economies are seeing recovery with increasing exports in Singapore and higher oil revenues for Brunei," he added. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar has been falling in recent sessions against the U.S. dollar, hitting a five-month low in overnight trading Thursday. \par \par \uc2  At 0440 GMT (11:50 p.m. Thursday EST), the U.S. dollar was at S$1.7130, barely changed from S$1.7136 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Gerard Teo, economist at ABN Amro Bank, agreed that the events in Brunei aren't registering on the radar screens of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders. \par \par \uc2  "The key thing driving the Singapore dollar is the (U.S.) dollar-yen relationship. The Singapore dollar is falling in line with other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  And the Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , for the time being, doesn't appear to be in any hurry to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar, he added. \par \par \uc2  "So far, we've seen no shift in their neutral policy," he said. \par \par \uc2  The Brunei government said Thursday it had started legal proceedings against Prince Jefri, freezing his assets and accusing him of improper use of state funds. Prince Jefri is the younger brother of the sultan of Brunei. \par \par \uc2  The Brunei dollar is pegged to the Singapore dollar on a one-to-one basis. The two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  move in virtual lockstep in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  -By Alan Yonan Jr.; 65-421-4859; alan.yonan@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw2p012u7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
