\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Higher Early; Recovers From Overnight Low \b0\par\par\uc2 208 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Januar 2000\par 03:12\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- The Singapore dollar is slightly higher early Wednesday after rebounding from overnight lows. \par \par \uc2  At about 0202 GMT (9:02 p.m. Tuesday EST), the U.S. dollar traded at S$1.6673, down from S$1.6684 late Tuesday and down from a peak of S$1.6710 during New York trading hours Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar regained some ground early Wednesday as a result of gains in the Thai baht and other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which often trade in tandem, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they see corporate interest to sell the U.S. dollar at the level of S$1.6710, the overnight peak. On the other hand, they expect strong support for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  around S$1.6650. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday to reinforce the U.S. dollar's rise against the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but that couldn't be confirmed. \par \par \uc2  Further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the MAS is unlikely, dealers said Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "I would be surprised if they came in at this moment," a dealer at a European bank said. "They just come in to smooth volatility" rather than influence the direction of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said. \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw1c002w6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
