\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Up Late But Off Highs On Suspected MAS Move \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 2000\par 10:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- The Singapore dollar is sharply higher against the U.S. dollar late Tuesday, but off its intraday highs following suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At about 0915 GMT (4:15 a.m. EST), the U.S. dollar was at S$1.6535, down from S$1.6600 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar rose to an intraday high of S$1.6465 against its U.S. counterpart as selling in the U.S. unit gained momentum throughout the day prior to the suspected MAS move. \par \par \uc2  "Players thought they would test the patience of the MAS," a dealer at a U.S. bank said. \par \par \uc2  Massive capital inflows into the Singapore stock market, which hit an all-time high of 2582.94 Monday, are fueling the Singapore dollar's rise, dealers say. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. bank dealer said, however, the MAS is likely to allow a gradual appreciation of the Singapore dollar since strong economic fundamentals and signs of incipient inflation support a stronger local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "They will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the (U.S. dollar's) way down" to smooth dramatic moves, but won't halt a gradual appreciation, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  In the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  money market, the overnight rate was offered unchanged at 0.250% from late Monday, while the three-month rate was offered at 2.4375%, down from 2.500%. \par \par \uc2  -By Anita Jain; 65-421-4807; anita.jain@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw14001wt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
